{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a future where the apocalypse consumed Earth in the year 2050.</strong><br>Fifty years later, humanity finally returns to reclaim what was lost, igniting a relentless war against the demons that now rule the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SurvivalEXtreme</strong> combines three intense experiences: <strong>multiplayer mode</strong>, <strong>single-player mode</strong>, and now the new <strong>competitive FPS mode</strong>, designed for the most tactical and aggressive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and customize your character, develop your combat style, and build a reputation that unlocks upgrades, abilities, and exclusive gear.<br><i>Legends are made here. What will yours be?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Survival (4 players)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of demons alongside three other players, earn money, upgrade your equipment, and evolve your character into a true war machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Competitive FPS Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action with classic and intense game modes such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free for All</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Domination</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE BEGINNING OF LEGEND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2406950/984e23b9a3d18b0a809bbedfb74147f22985a5b1.jpg"},{"name":"READY TO DIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2406950/f87cd43e627f345e8979d561a77523ebf2ff25c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE APOCALYPSE CANNOT WITH ME","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com